  "accounting_corrections": [
    "Edge counters are attempted recursive q calls; a final attempt can hit the node budget before a counted qnode. Descendant costs count only actual entered qnodes.",
    "The first completed iteration snapshots are used for completed cases; the Ng5-preroot depth-zero cases contain only the unfinished first iteration. Final later-iteration ancestry buckets are not used to infer first-iteration costs.",
